\[q+\bar{q}\rightarrow\gamma+g \tag{1.4}\]

This process is called annihilation process and represented by the Feynman diagrams in Fig. 1.4 and the other process,

\[q+\bar{q}\rightarrow\gamma+\gamma \tag{1.5}\]

