of anisotropy parameter \(\varepsilon\).

The event-by-event fluctuations in \(\varepsilon\) may cause fluctuations in elliptic flow. There may be other sources of elliptic flow fluctuations. To get an idea about the effect of eccentricity fluctuations on elliptic flow, different models for the eccentricity calculations have been used.

